WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.000
[Mouse drops and breaks] Web Accessibility Perspectives: Keyboard Compatibility. Not being able to use your computer because your mouse doesn't work is frustrating.

00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:13.000
Many people use only the keyboard to navigate websites—either through preference or circumstance.

00:00:13.000 --> 00:00:21.000
[Keyboard keystrokes] Whether it's temporarily limited mobility, a permanent physical disability, or simply a broken mouse, the result is the same.

00:00:21.000 --> 00:00:30.000
Websites and apps need to be operable by keyboard. Web accessibility: Essential for some, useful for all.
